      "severity": "blocking",
      "body": "Slide 17: MSL Scientific Exchange: Handling Unsolicited and Off-Label Questions\nConfirmed against the whole dossier: The text lists 'HER2+ maintenance combination' as a current FDA-approved indication. All evidence shown states IBRANCE (palbociclib) is approved only for HR+/HER2-NEGATIVE disease (AI, fulvestrant, or inavolisib+fulvestrant). No evidence supports a HER2+ indication; this appears to contradict the cited labeling.\n\nSuggested: Remove 'HER2+ maintenance combination.' On-label discussion should be limited to HR+/HER2-negative advanced/metastatic breast cancer: AI combination, fulvestrant combination, or inavolisib+fulvestrant for PIK3CA-mutated disease, per current Prescribing Information.",
